        "title": "👑 Pixaroma - Note - START HERE",
        "properties": {},
        "widgets_values": [
          "# MODELS AND NODES USED IN THIS WORKFLOW  \n\n## This workflow uses the Nunchaku node. See [Episode 02](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LDqD9Fp8J6g) for the tutorial.\n\n---\n\n## 🟣 Nunchaku FLUX DiT Loader\n##  !!! Download The right model for your card\n###  If you have 20, 30, 40 Series Nvidia Card \n### Download **svdq-int4_r32-fluxmania-legacy.safetensors** model from [HERE](https://huggingface.co/spooknik/Fluxmania-SVDQ/resolve/main/svdq-int4_r32-fluxmania-legacy.safetensors)\n\nOr\n\n###  If you have 50 Series Nvidia Card \n### Download **svdq-fp4_r32-fluxmania-legacy.safetensors** model from [HERE](https://huggingface.co/spooknik/Fluxmania-SVDQ/resolve/main/svdq-fp4_r32-fluxmania-legacy.safetensors)\n\n📁 **Place in:** `ComfyUI/models/diffusion_models/fluxmania` \n\nCreate the `fluxmania` folder if it does not exist\n  \n---\n\n## 🟣 Dual Clip Loader (GGUF) 1️⃣\n\n###  Download t5-v1_1-xxl-encoder-Q8_0.gguf from [HERE](https://huggingface.co/city96/t5-v1_1-xxl-encoder-gguf/resolve/main/t5-v1_1-xxl-encoder-Q8_0.gguf?download=true)  \n\n**Place in:** `ComfyUI/models/clip`  \n\n### Or a smaller variant from [HERE](https://huggingface.co/city96/t5-v1_1-xxl-encoder-gguf/tree/main)\n\n## 🟣 Dual Clip Loader (GGUF) 2️⃣\n\n###  Clip L model from [HERE](https://huggingface.co/comfyanonymous/flux_text_encoders/resolve/main/clip_l.safetensors?download=true)  \n\n**Place in:** `ComfyUI/models/clip`\n\n\n--- \n\n## 🟣 Load VAE\n\n### Download the **ae.safetensor** from [HERE](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/z_image_turbo/resolve/main/split_files/vae/ae.safetensors)  \n\n📁 **Place in:** `ComfyUI/models/vae`  \n\n---\n\n## 🧩 Nodes Installed from Manager  \n\n- **rgthree-comfy**\n- **ComfyUI-GGUF**\n- **Tiled Diffusion & VAE for ComfyUI**\n\n---\n\n## 🆙 Load Upscale Model  \n\n### Download 4x_NMKD-Siax_200k.pth mode from [HERE](https://huggingface.co/Akumetsu971/SD_Anime_Futuristic_Armor/resolve/main/4x_NMKD-Siax_200k.pth?download=true)  \n\n📁 **Place in:** `ComfyUI/models/upscale_models`\n\n\n---\n\n## 📚 Resources  \n🎥 **Tutorials:** [Pixaroma YouTube Channel](https://www.youtube.com/@pixaroma)  \n💬 **Community Discord:** [Join Here](https://discord.com/invite/gggpkVgBf3)\n"
        ],
